            "rating": 3,\
            "description": "The atmosphere is great very nice coffee shop but it seems like they dilute everything with milk. My Matcha taste like straight milk. I did ask them if they can remake it, which was very kind of them and they did, but it still taste like the same thing. Matcha has a grass taste and this just taste like milk\'85. 2% milk to be exact. Same with the coffee as well. You can add milk to the drink but not to the point where your missing the actual point of the drink\'85..If you\'92re gonna dilute everything with milk, just take it off the menu. The burritos are definitely a frozen burrito. The customer service is amazing I will not deny that. It just feels like where being stingy with products.",\
