            "rating": 5,\
            "description": "This is by far the BEST bagel that we have tasted in Florida! They are delicious! The breakfast burrito was fresh and super yummy. They make their tortillas by hand and you can def tell the difference. We happened to be in the area and stopped in for coffee and a slice of homemade lemon cake which was delicious. We loved it so much that we drove there the next day almost an hour away and in the pouring rain just so we could try the other items on their menu. The vibe is relaxed and the staff are friendly and welcoming. What are you waiting for? \uc0\u55357 \u56842 ",\
